license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-07-06'
abstract: >-
  CollectionBuilder-Remix is a beginner-friendly interface built on
  CollectionBuilder, an open source tool for creating digital collection
  and exhibit websites driven by metadata and powered by modern static
  web technology. This project's codebase descends from the Piñata
  Catalog (featuring a bilingual English-Spanish CollectionBuilder-GH implementation) and the
  Bajubá Digital Archive (updated code structure and adding the Portuguese translation).
